# There are NO secrets in this project, and none are needed.
#
# This service is read-only. It accepts no request body, no credential and no
# API key, and it makes no outbound model call. The page renders a recorded run
# from evidence/results.json, and the screening engine (RDKit) runs on your own
# machine when you run `python -m lab.orchestrator`.
#
# There was briefly a bring-your-own-key mode where a visitor could paste a
# provider key and have the lab write up its own run. It needed no server secret
# and cost nothing to host, but it made this an open proxy to somebody's
# account, so it was removed. Its endpoint now answers GET only.
#
# Do not add a real key to this file or to any file in the repository.